<p>I second the &quot;feeling opposite&quot; thing. The big appeal here is the subtle, simple effect as opposed to SCP-1561's blunt (though well done) play of the &quot;thing that makes people obey you&quot; trope. This goes from something very easy to write off as harmless and silly to something that could plausibly infect and destroy an entire site <em>because</em> it seems harmless and silly.</p>

