														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2390349">
									

<p>The way this is laid out hurts my suspension of disbelief. Most format screws of this type tend to have the explanation for why it is the way it is at the beginning, because that helps with the impression that this is a professional document with an actual purpose. This feels more like a document that might be attached to the main report in order to illustrate the things effects.</p>
<p>I get that having the note about why the format screw has been preserved at the end is supposed to allow the wrongness to draw the reader in, but it had the opposite effect on me. I had to force myself to get through the article to find the note.</p>

